==================================================
OPENING-WINDOW FEE ANALYSIS
==================================================

ROB separates fee components.

ORDINARY BASE FEE

Normal configured protocol fee.

CREATOR TAX

Creator-related allocation where applicable.

OPENING-WINDOW FEE

Additional protocol-defined early-period fee where applicable.

OTHER FEE

Any separately identified protocol component.

TOTAL REPORTED FEE

The value reported by the relevant trade event or protocol interface.

Where event semantics make the calculation valid:

INFERRED OPENING FEE

=
TOTAL REPORTED FEE
-
ORDINARY BASE FEE
-
CREATOR TAX
-
OTHER EXPLICIT FEE COMPONENTS

If the protocol does not expose sufficient information:

INFERRED OPENING FEE = UNKNOWN

Do not reverse-engineer a precise number from insufficient evidence.

