==================================================
CONVERGENCE
==================================================

Evidence converges when multiple independent sources support the same interpretation.

Example:

CHAIN DATA

Wallet enters within the first block.

PLUS

CROSS-LAUNCH DATA

Same wallet appears in the first block of six unrelated launches.

PLUS

TRANSACTION PATTERN

Trade construction is highly repetitive.

This may support:

REPEATED AUTOMATED-CANDIDATE

It still does not automatically establish operator identity.

==================================================
DIVERGENCE
==================================================

Evidence diverges when sources conflict.

Example:

Human researcher believes no announcement occurred.

But Discord logs show the token address was posted before launch.

The research record must preserve the conflict.

Do not rewrite the experiment condition after the fact.

